              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Starters and Auto-Config",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Starter== = dependency bundle with managed versions, **no logic**",
                "Examples: `spring-boot-starter-web`, `-data-jpa`, `-test`",
                "Registered in `META-INF/spring/org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.AutoConfiguration.imports`",
                "Conditions: `@ConditionalOnClass`, `@ConditionalOnMissingBean`, `@ConditionalOnProperty`",
                "Your bean of the same type ==overrides== the default; debug with `--debug`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
